This directory contains the hashes and signatures for Pirate Unified Wallet.

Verify the hashes by running:

  sha256sum -c sha256sum-vX.Y.Z.txt

Verify signatures:

1. Import the bundled Pirate Unified Wallet release key:

  gpg --import public_key.asc

2. Confirm the primary key fingerprint:

  gpg --fingerprint E4FB2399AECCF9B9447DED472CE65343401553A6

   Confirm that GPG shows this identity:

  Pirate Unified Wallet <dev@piratechainfoundation.com>

3. Verify the signed checksum manifest:

  gpg --verify sha256sum-vX.Y.Z.txt.sig sha256sum-vX.Y.Z.txt

4. Verify any downloaded release file directly:

  gpg --verify <filename.sig> <downloaded-filename>

A checksum confirms file integrity. A valid signature confirms that the file
was signed by the holder of the Pirate Unified Wallet release key. Neither
step decrypts a release file.
